@c In @svar{quasiquotation}s, a @svar{list qq template @var{D}} can
@c sometimes be confused with either an @svar{unquotation @var{D}} or a
@c @svar{splicing unquotation @var{D}}.

@c The interpretation as an @svar{unquotation} or
@c @svar{splicing unquotation @var{D}} takes precedence.

